description:
May I introduce you my chess game. I'm pretty sure I forgot to implement some game rules: just movement and capture feature are implemented. I didn't have time to animate it (it was out of the scope of my project). To play:
1) click a piece you want to move. A special indicator appear around the piece;
2) all cell you can move to are put in evidence by a red spot;
3) all pieces you can capture are surrounded by a red ring;
4) click the cell you want to move your piece o the piece you want to capture;
5) use key "A" and "D" to rotate the game board to have a better view of the game;
